[{:db/id "q-170378/selection/64cf78b972b1a6c00200fc0f3263d11084f341e9d74434632543237bbe007faa" :answer/id #uuid "a197cd42-53b0-55da-81a4-5c3fdb0286e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378/selection/f09f858c6b4928d28070dea02dd7dd452cc2556dfbc1c4e8f4575836248a37e0" :answer/id #uuid "96d3956e-159d-51b0-87b0-ef3091aedc61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378/selection/c605d8ed6c512d31b6710247b3a66630b338702cf519f73f94fbf24ff675be3c" :answer/id #uuid "34d24ae8-b487-56d2-9073-a22b5fa165ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378/selection/655ede254939c8720ff15fa47ebfaa58a37f5de0c0b757a45cc6bf14b9606903" :answer/id #uuid "4c8ded58-bdbd-5400-9b19-3fb6f1217574" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378/selection/a198a7b3bc8fad9fd44f348f8312126571b13148b33fca5b53ce8959974599a8" :answer/id #uuid "a7f8eea8-053e-5655-8e02-9a9e3376e166" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "edc01fba-7eff-590b-830c-5f2a7d173642" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-170378/selection/f09f858c6b4928d28070dea02dd7dd452cc2556dfbc1c4e8f4575836248a37e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-170378/selection/64cf78b972b1a6c00200fc0f3263d11084f341e9d74434632543237bbe007faa" "q-170378/selection/f09f858c6b4928d28070dea02dd7dd452cc2556dfbc1c4e8f4575836248a37e0" "q-170378/selection/c605d8ed6c512d31b6710247b3a66630b338702cf519f73f94fbf24ff675be3c" "q-170378/selection/655ede254939c8720ff15fa47ebfaa58a37f5de0c0b757a45cc6bf14b9606903" "q-170378/selection/a198a7b3bc8fad9fd44f348f8312126571b13148b33fca5b53ce8959974599a8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-170378" :question/id #uuid "075fe6de-58ec-5896-b63e-8c0d09f0a158" :question/math-academy-id "q-170378" :question/problem "The minimum value of the quadratic form $Q(x)=3{x}_{1}^{2}-4{x}_{1}{x}_{2},$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to $-1.$ Which of the following is a vector $x$ at which the minimum is attained?" :question/worked-solution "Let $A$ be the matrix corresponding to our quadratic form. Recall that: \n\n- The maximum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the largest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmax{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1}={\\lambda }_{\\text{max}}\n$$\n\n \nThe  maximum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{max}}.$\n\n- The minimum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the smallest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmin{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1}={\\lambda }_{\\text{min}}\n$$\n\n \nThe minimum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{min}}.$\n\nFirst, we write down the matrix of our quadratic form:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, we need the unit eigenvector that corresponds to the eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{\\text{min}}=-1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-1)I & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-1)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$  \n\nFinally, dividing $v$ by its norm $‖v‖=\\sqrt{5},$ we get \n\n$$\n{u}_{\\text{min}}=\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-170378/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6115493b-482c-5360-8d19-5258